  "notes": "Abdullah Al-Othaim Markets Company (a Saudi Joint Stock Company, ticker 4001) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/432_0_2026-03-30...). Auditor Ernst & Young. The auditor's report (printed pages 2-6) is digital text; the five primary statements (printed pages 7-11) are scanned images (transcribed from page renders at 2.5x); the notes are digital text. Amounts are in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1). Board of Directors approved the statements on 26 Ramadan 1447H / 15 March 2026 (used as filed_at). income_taxes_and_zakat is the net zakat/tax effect: FY2025 is 'Zakat and foreign tax' of -11,131,509; FY2024 is 'Zakat and foreign tax' of -17,056,983 net of a 'Zakat reversal for prior years' of +17,692,592, i.e. a net +635,609 credit. operating_income is the reported 'Operating profit' (after rental income, sold-voucher commissions, selling and marketing and G&A). rental_income is 'Rental income, net' (Al-Othaim sublets space in its stores/malls). share_of_profit_associates is 'Share in profit or loss of associates and joint venture, net'. other_reserves combines the fair value reserve, the currency-translation reserve and the share of associates'/JV OCI. long_term_debt is nil (no non-current borrowings); current_debt is 'Short term loans'. IFRS 16 lease liabilities are mapped separately as lease_liabilities_current / lease_liabilities_noncurrent. defined_benefit_obligation is 'Obligation for employees' end-of-service benefits'. long_term_investments is 'Financial assets at amortized cost and others' plus 'Financial assets at fair value through income statement' plus 'Equity instruments at FVOCI' (carried as one line); investments_associates is 'Investments in associates and joint venture'. depreciation_amortization sums depreciation of property, plant, equipment and right-of-use assets, depreciation of investment properties and amortisation of intangible assets from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Additions to property, plant, and equipment'. interest_paid is 'Finance costs paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat and foreign tax paid'; dividends_paid is the shareholder dividend (NCI dividends of SAR 2,562,560 excluded). The cash-flow statement reconciles with a separate 'Net exchange differences on translation of foreign currencies' line. Statement page references are the printed page numbers: financial position 7, income 8, comprehensive income 9, changes in equity 10, cash flows 11.",
